{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120034234758-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120082821\"/><p>今日(20日)凌晨1時27分，一名尼泊爾裔男子，在油麻地上海街251號油麻地玉器小販市場對開暈倒，其友人發現報案求助。救援人員接報到場，47歲事主現場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，事主早前曾向友人表示身體不適。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.662820+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T19:42:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:17:28.306223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:32.049969+00:00","content_hash":"ac9078593831c461cc83f8d054c37d9214d01a4779c636dc89d1a92aefa02eb5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}